          "wrong": 1,
          "fix": "cami — “jamee”",
          "options": [
            "cami — “jamee”",
            "cami — “sammy”"
          ],
          "explanation": "c is always “j,” as in jam. Never “k,” never “s.” Mosque reads “jamee.” And gece is right: hard g, c = “j,” and the last e is said."
